    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2c/Lycoris_Flower_of_Death_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260122015301\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Lycoris Flower of Death Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"917\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Lycoris Flower of Death Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lycoris_Flower_of_Death_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2c/Lycoris_Flower_of_Death_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260122015301\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eFlower of Death\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA young ninja skilled in the arts of torture and interrogation. Her blade can whip up a storm of blood and still never bring her victim the sweet release of death. The blood that spurts from wounds she inflicts create patterns of painted red flowers.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae5b3b6150bca1bc44a1b909c7c56fd2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Spicy_Lycoris_Queen-s_bla